  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0: BREAKING - Replaced MassTransit's IPublishEndpoint with Swevo.AutoBus's IMessageBus as the publish mechanism. Removes the MassTransit dependency entirely. Existing MassTransit users should register Swevo.AutoBus (with or without a transport) to get an IMessageBus in DI; see README for the migration guide. 1.0.1: Prior MassTransit-based release.",
